gas-portal uses the Lucide external-link, refresh-cw, layout-grid, list,
tool-case, list-checks, settings, calendar-days, calendar-off, pin, pin-off,
bell-off, and coffee icons.
Their ISC and applicable MIT copyright/license notices are retained in
src/assets/*.svg, the distributed assets/external-link.svg, and the
generated HTML that embeds these icons.

Runtime dependencies @google/clasp and Vite are installed separately by npm
and retain their own licenses. They are not copied into gas-portal's sources.

Generated favicon images use Libre Baskerville, copyright 2012 The Libre
Baskerville Project Authors (https://github.com/impallari/Libre-Baskerville),
licensed under SIL Open Font License 1.1. The font is a development-only
npm dependency. Its full license is copied to the published favicon site
as FONT-LICENSE.txt. Font binaries are not included in the GAS output.

Generated kana favicons use Shippori Mincho, copyright 2021 The Shippori
Mincho Project Authors (https://github.com/fontdasu/ShipporiMincho), licensed
under SIL Open Font License 1.1. The full license from this development-only
font dependency is published as JAPANESE-FONT-LICENSE.txt. Font binaries
are not included in the GAS output.

The fallback favicon is the unmodified outline of the character 玄 from
Kouzan Brush Font Sousho (衡山毛筆フォント草書), written and created by
Aoyagi Kouzan (青柳衡山), distributed by Musashi System.
Source: https://opentype.jp/kouzansousho.htm
Font archive: https://opentype.jp/bin/KouzanSousho.zip (2017-04-11 edition).
The publisher permits free use, including commercial and logo use,
without restrictions, and provides the font without warranty.
Only the single glyph artwork is included; the original font is not
bundled. The font is not claimed to be covered by this project's MIT license.

Service logos (GitHub Octocat, Slack, Gmail, Google Calendar and Google Drive)
are sourced from https://cdn.svglogos.dev/logos/ (gilbarbara/logos).
The collection is published under CC0 1.0; its license is retained in
src/assets/brands/LICENSE.txt and the distributed assets/brand-logos-LICENSE.txt.
Original SVGs are kept in src/assets/brands and embedded in the generated CSS.
All logos and trademarks remain the property of their respective owners.
Source: https://github.com/gilbarbara/logos

Coffee steam animation adapted from Animate UI (default variant):
https://github.com/imskyleen/animate-ui/blob/main/apps/v2/registry/icons/coffee/index.tsx

